  <item>
    <title>05. 想好了吗？这辈子真就不结婚了？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/675099816e468089a8a34e5a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">675099816e468089a8a34e5a</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 05 Dec 2024 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，时隔近两个月，《我的普通女友》终于轻磅回归啦～感谢还在等待和催更的朋友们。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期邀请到了我们的好朋友小齐！三个适婚年龄但还没结婚的女人，聚在一起聊了聊我们对婚姻的想象；小时候都幻想过当新娘、拥有一场盛大婚礼的我们，为什么成长到如今会对婚姻祛魅。</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢大家订阅收听，也欢迎在评论区分享自己的看法和经历。</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后，问白玫瑰安。</span></p><span></span><p><span>「时间线」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a> 看完《好东西》，闺蜜和我求婚了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="682">11:22</a> 做男朋友，最重要的是要讲义气！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="966">16:06</a> 小齐：我那离了三次婚的妈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1499">24:59</a> 粽子：我那离了三次婚的爹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1645">27:25</a> 亲戚眼里那个失败的大龄未婚表姐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2120">35:20</a> 想象中的婚礼：从浮夸的海岛到秋天的草坪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2738">45:38</a> 没有在QQ炫舞上结过婚的女人是不完整的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3571">59:31</a> 到底谁才是那个“真正对的人”啊？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4064">01:07:44</a> 虽然不想结婚，但小孩的名字已经起好了！</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: I Will Never Marry - Joan Baez</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lp_vlySSVv258OYS5PXwJAhcdzkt.m4a" length="117863722" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:21:15</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvK3JUsrc4DoqZ54sD5ivDK3ZTsM.png"/>
